VERDICT on the registered hypotheses: the user's outs-conditioning
shows NO mid-game signal (C2b/C3), and the t2 low-card exception
does NOT generalize past j=1 (C2 sign flips). Registered decision
rule -> no confirmation for C1-pooled/C2.

EXPLORATORY selection (one of the 11 registered C1 margin cells,
so winner's-curse rules apply — re-enters at a fresh seed):
  j=2 (first turn-3 node), bot takes, no meld: -8.67 +/- 7.65
  (n=64; was -17.13 +/- 11.74 at the 600-row interim). This is the
  turn-decay continuation of the j=1 leak (-1.92/take, v8 gates
