DECISIONS:
  Phase 2 (targeted C2 run, seed 92000) SKIPPED: powering up a
  wrong-signed cell is not leverage; seed retired unused.
  Phase 3 confirmation RE-TARGETED (allowed by registration: an
  exploratory contrast re-enters with its own fresh seed): cell =
  (j==2 & bot_takes & ~melds), hypothesis dEV(take) < 0, seed
