LEAK HUNT (2026-09-04, user direction): force-arm audit of the
remaining never-audited decision surfaces, hunting the bot's
largest systematic misplay (the turn-1/turn-2 method, generalized).
Surfaces already audited clean: opening (book), j=1 take (book),
j>=2 take/draw (this campaign, phases 1+3). Never audited:
KNOCK TIMING and DISCARD SAFETY. Registered before launch.
